    "titulo": "Work and introducing yourself professionally",
    "objetivo": "Name jobs and workplaces, say what you do, and handle a short job interview in the formal «Lei» way of speaking. Leave out the article in «Sono insegnante», use the reflexive «mi occupo di» and «mi sono laureata», and use «da» + the present for a job that is still going on, but «per» + the passato prossimo for a job that has ended. Avoid the English-speaker traps: «per» after «cercare» and «ho» with a reflexive verb.",
